    "description": "Calling all developers or buyers with vision!!!    Located in the famously crooked portion of Vermont St., this highly sought-after Potrero Hill neighborhood with sweeping city views, offers a rare opportunity to bring your vision to life. Set on a spacious lot, the current residence features a charming 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom home, complemented by a bonus studio space with its own private entranceperfect for guests, an office, or creative use. With multi-family zoning, the potential here is limitless, whether you're looking to expand, renovate, or redevelop entirely.  The front yard offers plenty of room to create your own outdoor oasis, enhancing the property's allure. Enjoy easy access to public transportation, just a 9-minute drive to downtown, close to Zuckerberg SF General Hospital, UCSF Med Center, tech companies, vibrant community garden, McKinley Square Park, shopping, cafes, dining, and nightlife. This is truly a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to create your ideal home or investment in an unbeatable location! VACANT and Zoned RH2."
